    "body": "@fabienengels Unfortunately, there's only so much space in a prompt, and we haven't implemented smart pruning yet (e.g. certain modules getting cut off or un-rendered when the prompt extends past a certain point), so we've opted to disable certain modules, both to save space in the prompt and because we assume that some modules can be enabled by advanced users when needed.\r\n\r\nI will say that I'm not entirely happy with our current system for disabling/enabling/ordering modules in the prompt, because there's *a lot* to keep track of, but we haven't had the time to think about rearchitecting it so far.",
