    "updated_at": "2020-03-10T18:34:57Z",
    "body": "Maybe there is something deeper going on here, this seems to work perfectly for me.\r\n\r\nAlways enabled\r\n```\r\n~/s/r/starship on  master is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0 took 5s\r\n❯ starship configure\r\n~/s/r/starship on  master (af5071d) is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0 took 3s \r\n❯ cat ~/.config/starship.toml \r\nadd_newline = false\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nfish_style_pwd_dir_length = 1\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"\r\n\r\n[git_commit]\r\nonly_detached = false\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nshow_sync_count = true\r\n\r\n[kubernetes]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n~/s/r/starship on  master (af5071d) is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0 \r\n❯ starship --version\r\nstarship 0.37.0\r\n```\r\nWith only detached\r\n```\r\n~/s/r/starship on  master (af5071d) is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0\r\n❯ starship configure                                             \r\n~/s/r/starship on  master is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0        \r\n❯ cat ~/.config/starship.toml\r\nadd_newline = false                                               \r\n\r\n[directory]                      \r\nfish_style_pwd_dir_length = 1\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"        \r\n\r\n[git_status]  \r\nshow_sync_count = true\r\n                     \r\n[kubernetes]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n~/s/r/starship on  master is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0        \r\n❯ git checkout HEAD^1        \r\nNote: switching to 'HEAD^1'.\r\n\r\nYou are in 'detached HEAD' state. You can look around, make experimental\r\nchanges and commit them, and you can discard any commits you make in this\r\nstate without impacting any branches by switching back to a branch.\r\n\r\nIf you want to create a new branch to retain commits you create, you may\r\ndo so (now or later) by using -c with the switch command. Example:\r\n\r\n  git switch -c <new-branch-name>\r\n                \r\nOr undo this operation with:                                   \r\n                     \r\n  git switch -                                                               \r\n                           \r\nTurn off this advice by setting config variable advice.detachedHead to false\r\n                                                       \r\nHEAD is now at 47ba291 build(deps): bump open from 1.3.4 to 1.4.0\r\n~/s/r/starship on  HEAD (47ba291) is 📦 v0.37.0 via 🦀 v1.40.0\r\n❯                                                          \r\n```",
