    "body": "@chipbuster I see now why :)\r\n\r\n@matchai I understand too as my need is a bit specific. We tag our docker images with the git hash so it's handy to directly have the hash displayed but most of developers won't need it.\r\n\r\nI tried on another machine and it's enable by default, I'll dig the problem on my side but it seems starship works as expected or I was really tired yesterday >_<\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
